msgid "comp7_light_aggressive_detection/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"观察范围将提高{colorTagOpen}%(visionBuff_1)s/%(visionBuff_2)s/%(visionBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"当您点亮的敌方坦克被击毁时，能力持续时间将重置。"

msgid "comp7_light_aggressive_detection/name"
msgstr "激进侦察"

msgid "comp7_light_ally_support/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"团队中每一种不同的坦克角色可让乘员效率获得{colorTagOpen}%(crewBuff_1)s/%(crewBuff_2)s/%(crewBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}的加成，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"计算该加成时，自身坦克将始终包括在内。"

msgid "comp7_light_ally_support/name"
msgstr "薪火相传"

msgid "comp7_light_aoe_heal/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"坦克周围生成{colorTagOpen}%(radius)s米{colorTagClose}半径的领域，为自身及领域内的盟友坦克恢复{colorTagOpen}%(heal_1)s/%(heal_2)s/%(heal_3)s{colorTagClose}点生命值，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_aoe_heal/name"
msgstr "现场维修"

msgid "comp7_light_aoe_inspire/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"自身及盟友坦克的乘员效率获得{colorTagOpen}%(crewBuff_1)s/%(crewBuff_2)s/%(crewBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}的加成，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_aoe_inspire/name"
msgstr "鼓舞"

msgid "comp7_light_berserk/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"装填时间缩短{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}，同时，射击后、移动时、车体及炮塔旋转时的炮弹散布范围降低{colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"当通过撞击或在{colorTagOpen}%(damageDistance)s米{colorTagClose}内射击造成损伤时，能力持续时间将重置。"

msgid "comp7_light_berserk/name"
msgstr "狂怒"

msgid "comp7_light_concentration/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"瞄准时间与移动时、车体和炮塔旋转时的炮弹散布范围降低{colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"该角色能力激活时，短装填时间缩短{colorTagOpen}%(clipReloadTimeBoost_1)s/%(clipReloadTimeBoost_2)s/%(clipReloadTimeBoost_3)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_concentration/name"
msgstr "专注目标"

msgid "comp7_light_fast_recharge/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"对于弹夹装填系统:\n"
"\n"
"剩余的弹夹装填时间将缩短{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"对于自动装填系统:\n"
"\n"
"当前装填循环中，所有已射出炮弹的装填时间将缩短{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff_1)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_2)s/%(gunReloadTimeBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"此能力仅在装填过程中才可激活。"

msgid "comp7_light_fast_recharge/name"
msgstr "得心应手"

msgid "comp7_light_hunter/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"重置受到射击损伤的敌方坦克计数。\n"
"\n"
"该能力激活时，已计数的每辆受到射击损伤的敌方坦克将为自身坦克恢复{colorTagOpen}%(heal_1)s/%(heal_2)s/%(heal_3)s{colorTagClose}点生命值，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_hunter/descr/passive"
msgstr ""
"每对一辆敌方坦克造成射击损伤，装填时间缩短{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadTimeBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_hunter/name"
msgstr "赏金猎人"

msgid "comp7_light_juggernaut/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"{colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s秒{colorTagClose}生效期间内:\n"
"• 受到的损伤降低{colorTagOpen}%(dmgAbsorbBuff_1)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_2)s/%(dmgAbsorbBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"• 最大前进速度提高{colorTagOpen}%(fwMaxSpeedBonus)s千米/小时{colorTagClose}\n"
"• 最大倒车速度提高{colorTagOpen}%(bkMaxSpeedBonus)s千米/小时{colorTagClose}\n"
"• 发动机功率提高{colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"• 对敌方坦克造成的撞击损伤提高{colorTagOpen}%(rammingDamageBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}\n"
"\n"
"该角色能力激活时，您的履带只能承受1次射击。"

msgid "comp7_light_juggernaut/name"
msgstr "强力猛冲"

msgid "comp7_light_march/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"您坦克的发动机功率将提高{colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}，最大速度将提高{colorTagOpen}%(fwdSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose}千米/小时，隐蔽系数将提高{colorTagOpen}%(invisibilityFactor)s%%{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_march/name"
msgstr "战术转移"

msgid "comp7_light_recon/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"{colorTagOpen}%(delay)s秒{colorTagClose}后，侦察机将飞越指定区域。{colorTagOpen}%(radius_1)s/%(radius_2)s/%(radius_3)s米{colorTagClose}半径范围内被发现的敌方坦克将在{colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s秒{colorTagClose}内保持可见。{colorTagOpen}%(lampDelay)s秒{colorTagClose}延迟后，被该能力发现的玩家将在界面上看到一个单独的图标。\n"
"\n"
"战斗开始{colorTagOpen}%(startupDelay)s秒{colorTagClose}后，该能力开放使用。"

msgid "comp7_light_recon/name"
msgstr "侦察飞行"

msgid "comp7_light_redline/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"炮击会在{colorTagOpen}%(delay)s秒{colorTagClose}后攻击指定区域。\n"
"\n"
"对{colorTagOpen}%(radius_1)s/%(radius_2)s/%(radius_3)s米{colorTagClose}半径范围内的所有坦克造成持续{colorTagOpen}%(stunDuration_1)s/%(stunDuration_2)s/%(stunDuration_3)s秒{colorTagClose}的弹震，并对范围内的所有敌方坦克造成{colorTagOpen}%(damage_1)s/%(damage_2)s/%(damage_3)s{colorTagClose}点的损伤。"

msgid "comp7_light_redline/name"
msgstr "火力掩护"

msgid "comp7_light_risky_attack/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"加速\n"
"\n"
"发动机功率提高{colorTagOpen}%(enginePowerBuff)s%%{colorTagClose}，最大前进速度提高{colorTagOpen}%(fwdSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose}千米/小时，最大倒车速度提高{colorTagOpen}%(bkwSpeedBoost)s{colorTagClose}千米/小时，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"恢复\n"
"\n"
"您的坦克将恢复{colorTagOpen}%(baseHeal)s{colorTagClose}点生命值{colorTagOpen}+%(extraHealFactor_1)s/%(extraHealFactor_2)s/%(extraHealFactor_3)s%%{colorTagClose}加速过程中损失的生命值，持续{colorTagOpen}%(healDuration)s秒{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_risky_attack/name"
msgstr "险中求胜"

msgid "comp7_light_role_skill/descr/startLevel"
msgstr ""
" \n"
"\n"
"战斗开始时，该角色能力的充能等级为{colorTagOpen}%(startLevel)s{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_sniper/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"100米精度将等于{colorTagOpen}%(dispersionFactor)s米{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration_1)s/%(duration_2)s/%(duration_3)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"如果坦克射击时没有被点亮，其射击造成的损伤将提高{colorTagOpen}%(damageFactors_1)s/%(damageFactors_2)s/%(damageFactors_3)s%%{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"在{colorTagOpen}%(damageDistance)s米{colorTagClose}外造成射击损伤时，能力持续时间将重置。"

msgid "comp7_light_sniper/name"
msgstr "百步穿杨"

msgid "comp7_light_sure_shot/descr/active"
msgstr ""
"移动时、车体和炮塔旋转时的炮弹散布范围降低{colorTagOpen}%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_1)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_2)s/%(shotDispersionFactorsBuff_3)s%%{colorTagClose}，持续{colorTagOpen}%(duration)s秒{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"该能力激活时，对敌方坦克造成损伤可缩短装填时间，缩短的百分比为敌方坦克生命值减少百分比的{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadBuffDamage_1)s/%(gunReloadBuffDamage_2)s/%(gunReloadBuffDamage_3)s%%{colorTagClose}。\n"
"\n"
"击毁敌方坦克可缩短装填时间{colorTagOpen}%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_1)s/%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_2)s/%(gunReloadBuffDestroy_3)s%%{colorTagClose}。"

msgid "comp7_light_sure_shot/name"
msgstr "精准射击"
